WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
It's easy to open a hotel, but to run a
hotel is where the real game starts.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Recently I worked on a 24 rooms hotel
project.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
And to be honest, 24 rooms, 24 problems.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In the beginning, everyone thought it was
simple.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.720
You can hire staff, clean rooms, do online
listing, you will get booking

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.720
But as soon as the execution started

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:26.160
Issues with the TV, AC, plumbing, cleaning,
kitchen and staff.

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.960
That is when I understood: daily execution
matters more than just the plan.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Daily execution.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
We made room-wise checklist, set daily
priority, coordinated vendors, set up

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.000
kitchen,

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
We onboarded on Zomato and Swiggy and solved
one problem each day.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.000
The simple formula of execution is

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Identify the problem

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Assign an owner, follow up and check the
progress.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Whether it is a hotel or any business,

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Growth needs an execution rhythm, not just
an idea.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Want to understand how a weekly execution
sprint works?

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.000
DM SPRINT

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.000
and follow the page.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Thank you.

